        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "AbaFilisiti bakalusia Lisanduku liOMWAMI",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lisanduku liOMWAMI lialiyo mushialo shiabaFilisiti emiesi musaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaFilisiti nabo nibalanga abeesaaliisi nende abafumu, bari Nakhulikhole khurie lisanduku liOMWAMI? Mukhumanyie eshia nakhulirume ninashio habundu walio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo nibaboola bari Nimuba nimurusia lisanduku liaNyasaye waIsiraeli, muralirusia nilili likhaya tawe; ne kakhoyeele mbu mumukalusilie omusango kweshiuku, mana mulahonibwa, khandi kalamumanyishila akeene akachila omukhonokwe nikuramurusibwakhwo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo nibareeba bari Nomusango tsana kweshiuku okwa khumukalusilia kulaba shiina? Nabo nibakalusiamwo bari Amabumba karaano keitsahaabu, nende tsimbeba tsiaraano tsieitsahaabu, obunji bwabaami babaFilisiti shinga olwa buli; shichila oluumbe lulala lwamuupa mwesi, halala nende abaami beenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila mulakhola ebifwanani biamabumba keenywe, nende ebifwanani bietsimbeba tsieenywe etsionooninjia eshialo; khandi mulaheelesia Nyasaye waIsiraeli oluyali; haundi alamwanguyilia omukhonokwe, nende khubanyasaye beenywe, nende khushialo shieenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayaye! Mbushiina nimuuminjia emioyo chieenywe, shinga abaMisiri nende Farao olwa boomia emioyo chiabwe? Olwa yali nabanyokhosiye, shibalekhuula abandu, nabo nibeenyokha ni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano mubukule likaari liyia, mulikasie, nende tsitwasi tsibili etsinuuninjia, etsishili okhureebwakhwo likokolo ta, mubohe tsitwasi etsio khwikaari; ne mutsirusiekhwo ebimoosi biatsio, mubiyile hango; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana mubukule lisanduku liOMWAMI, mulirenjeshe khwikaari; nebindu ebio bieitsahaabu ebia mumukalusilia bibe omusango kweshiuku, mubire mukhasanduku khandi, halala ninalio; mulirume litsie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulole, niliba nilitikulukha nilibirila khunjila yolwakho lwalio liene, okhuula eBetse-shemeshi, kho niye owakhukholela eshibii eshikhongo shino; ne nilirakhola lirio ta, kho khulamanya mbu shikwali omukhono kukwe okwakhukhupa tawe; kali amaraba butswa akakhukwila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu abo nibakhola bario; babukula tsitwasi tsibili etsinuuninjia, nibatsiboha khwikaari, nibeekalila ebimoosi biatsio hango; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibara lisanduku liOMWAMI khwikaari, halala nende akhasanduku akhalimwo tsimbeba tsieitsahaabu nende ebifwanani biamabumba kabwe ako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsitwasi natsio nitsilonda khunjila inunji eyitsia eBetse-shemeshi; tsialonda khumuhanda mulala nitsiana nitsitsia, nitsirashiama khumukhono omusaatsa kata khumukhasi ta; nabo abaami babaFilisiti nibatsilondakhwo munyuma watsio okhuula khulwakho lwaBetse-shemeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abeBetse-shemeshi bali nibali mwichesa lieingana mwibanda; nibachinguula tsimoni, nibalola lisanduku elo; nolwa balilola, nibeekhoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalio likaari niliinjila mumukunda kwaYoswa omuBetse-shemeshi, niliemamwo, aha lichina liali likhongo; mana nibaasiaka tsimbaho tsielikaari, nibamala tsitwasi omusango omusambe kwOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abaLawi nibaakula lisanduku IiOMWAMI, nende akhasanduku akhali ninalio halala, akhalimwo ebindu bieitsahaabu, nibabira khwichina likhongo elo; abandu beBetse-shemeshi nibamumalila OMWAMI emisango emisambe, nibahaana ebihaanwa, inyanga yeneyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa abaami abo baraano babaFilisiti bali nibaluutsi, bakalukha eEkeroni inyanga yeneyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne amabumba keitsahaabu aka abaFilisiti bakalusia kabe omusango kweshiuku khuMWAMI ngakano; mbu eliaAshidodi elala, neliaGaza elala, neliaAshekeloni elala, neliaGatsi elala, neliaEkeroni elala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi nende tsimbeba tsieitsahaabu, shinga obunji bwamatookho kabaFilisiti olwa bwali, aka baami batsana baraano, kata amatookho akasilwakhwo tsingoba, kata amataala butswa akomumikunda. Ne lichina likhongo elo, elia barenjekhakhwo lisanduku liOMWAMI, nalio lishiliho okhuula olwa leelo mumukunda kwaYoswa omuBetse-shemeshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye OMWAMI yakhupa abandi abokhubandu beBetse-shemeshi, shichila bali nibahenjeeleele mwisanduku IiOMWAMI; ne khubandu abo yakhupa abandu amakhumi musaafu; abandu nibeekhuula, shichila OMWAMI yali nakhupile abandu nende obwiri obukhongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu beBetse-shemeshi nibareeba bari Niwina ounyala okhusinjila imbeli wOMWAMI, Nyasaye uno omutakatifu? Kata nakhurulekhwo natikulushe ewabeena? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibaruma abarumwa ewabeKiriatsiyearimu, nibasunga bari AbaFilisiti bakalusiye lisanduku liOMWAMI; kholomoshe muliende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
